Nomi hoseru ka sae shirazu

00:01:57.840 --> 00:02:01.470
If they could drink up the new world

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:04.470
Subete houri nageta

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:04.470
Like a savory wine

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:07.630
Shinsekai wa tsumetai risei to

