The new world resides

00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:10.350
Kiseki no hazama

00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:10.350
Between boring logic and miracles

00:02:10.570 --> 00:02:19.360
Doushite koko de kimi to aeta no

00:02:10.570 --> 00:02:19.360
I wonder why this is where I first met you

