ihsasuM
llepS htlaetS

00:02:58.690 --> 00:03:02.220
<i>The main ship will hereby
enter stealth mode.</i>

00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:03.900
<i>That is all.</i>

00:03:13.980 --> 00:03:18.190
Innocents at the Table

00:03:15.150 --> 00:03:17.910
Practically starving to death
is serious, Masazumi.

00:03:17.910 --> 00:03:21.550
You need to find a better job
so you can eat properly.

00:03:24.650 --> 00:03:26.290
I'll try to watch myself.

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:28.400
You're welcome here anytime.

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:31.440
So, got any Student Council
work later today?

00:03:31.740 --> 00:03:33.720
Yes, it's my duty as vice-president

00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:36.760
to accompany President Sakai
to Mikawa's checkpoint.

00:03:36.760 --> 00:03:39.400
But I'd like to visit my mother's grave first.

00:03:39.670 --> 00:03:43.240
You see, we're both originally
from Mikawa, so...

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:47.230
Also, I apologize for constantly
inconveniencing you.

00:03:47.230 --> 00:03:49.880
Someday I'll become
a good politician and...

00:03:49.880 --> 00:03:51.750
Don't worry about it!

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:55.920
Come to think of it, didn't you want to
become a provisional councilor?

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:59.980
Why did you run for vice-president instead
of president of the Student Council?

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:03.130
Because Chancellor Aoi was
one of the candidates.

00:04:03.600 --> 00:04:05.920
I've only been here a year,

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:07.940
but he was born here,

00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:10.310
so I thought he would have a better
understanding of everyone.

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:13.440
But he's always been such a goof.

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:15.600
Take this with you.

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:19.440
I used to serve this to Tori
and the neighborhood kids.

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:20.440
Aoi ate this?

00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:21.260
Yep!

00:04:21.770 --> 00:04:27.340
You see, Tori stopped coming here
a decade ago, clear up until last year.

00:04:27.940 --> 00:04:34.340
But ever since I took in a lost automated
doll with amnesia that had a citizen ID,

00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:36.250
he's started coming by every morning.

00:04:36.680 --> 00:04:40.000
I bet he's enchanted by my P-01s.

00:04:40.310 --> 00:04:43.280
Eh?! He's into P-01s?

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:44.760
What a fetish...

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:46.320
Worried for him?

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:49.350
And I thought you hated Tori, Masazumi.

00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:51.970
I wouldn't say I hate him...

00:04:52.210 --> 00:04:54.870
If you want to get closer to everyone,

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:56.690
look into Remorse Way.

00:04:57.180 --> 00:04:58.290
Remorse Way?

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:02.070
There you'll find the truth
that's eluding you.

00:05:03.010 --> 00:05:04.950
Is it related to that monument?

00:05:05.330 --> 00:05:06.200
Yep!

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:08.200
Keep pursuing the truth.

00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:11.220
Remorse Way...

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:14.640
10:43 A.M.
Musashi Ariadust Academy

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:15.230
In Far East History today,

00:05:15.230 --> 00:05:18.010
we'll cover the Harmonic Unification War,

00:05:18.010 --> 00:05:20.460
which caused the Divine States to
fall under provisional rule.

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:24.160
Suzu, explain as much as
you can about it for me.

00:05:24.730 --> 00:05:26.720
Will a review be okay?

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:27.870
You bet!

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:29.680
I want ya to teach class for me.

00:05:29.940 --> 00:05:30.840
Good luck!

00:05:30.840 --> 00:05:32.200
Uh, okay...

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:39.500
A..A long time ago,
the Divine States in the real world

00:05:39.500 --> 00:05:43.690
and their copy, the Harmonic Divine States,
existed on separate planes.

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:47.000
The Divine States' citizens lived
in the original one.

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:49.760
People from other countries

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:53.390
lived in the Harmonic Divine States
found on another world.

00:05:53.390 --> 00:05:54.820
I think they got along...

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:55.590
You're doing good!

00:05:55.590 --> 00:05:56.720
Hey, Bell!

00:05:56.720 --> 00:05:57.670
Loosen up.

00:05:58.140 --> 00:06:01.040
If you goof up, I'll let her punch me for you.

00:06:01.230 --> 00:06:06.570
Nuruhachi!
Customer Survey

00:06:01.430 --> 00:06:02.890
I'll be okay!

00:06:02.890 --> 00:06:06.590
I can't die today until I hit the
first branch in this erotic game.

00:06:06.590 --> 00:06:07.910
Hey, now!

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:09.930
Don't act like you're about to die!

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:12.350
And why are you filling out that survey?!

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:14.000
Jeez, Teach!

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:16.970
I just want the special membership bonus,
so bug off!

00:06:16.970 --> 00:06:18.350
Pipe down, Tori.

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:19.980
I'm trying to work.

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:24.930
But Shiro, I'm pretty sure
we're in the middle of class.

00:06:24.930 --> 00:06:25.980
How strange...

00:06:25.980 --> 00:06:27.490
I don't have any orders from Mikawa.

00:06:27.940 --> 00:06:30.900
Hey, Gacchan, about the storyboard here...

00:06:30.900 --> 00:06:32.120
It should be more like this.

00:06:34.010 --> 00:06:35.960
Be quiet already.

00:06:35.960 --> 00:06:37.830
I can't focus on my manuscript.

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:39.540
Uh...

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:42.360
Asama, help her out.

00:06:42.910 --> 00:06:43.910
Okay!

00:06:43.910 --> 00:06:47.840
Suzu, may I read your review for you?

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:50.600
S..Sure! Please do.

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:52.950
It all...

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:55.760
It all started with the Nanboku-cho Wars.

00:06:55.930 --> 00:06:59.440
The war was waged in a land in the

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:03.480
Far East called the Divine States
between two imperial courts.

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:06.320
In 1412 Testament Era,

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:10.570
the sacred instruments used to support
the tectonic plates vanished,

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:13.990
and the Harmonic Divine States
came crashing down.

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:17.990
Over half of that world was
destroyed as it collapsed.

00:07:17.990 --> 00:07:22.970
The remaining parts relocated or
fused with our Divine States.

00:07:22.970 --> 00:07:27.210
As such, patches of the
Harmonic Divine States' land

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:30.350
is interspersed throughout
the Divine States.

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:35.480
People from across the world who had
lived in the Harmonic Divine States

00:07:35.480 --> 00:07:38.160
flocked to the Divine States.

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:40.600
They blamed the Divine States
for the tragedy

00:07:40.930 --> 00:07:42.810
and war ravaged the land.

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:45.690
That was the Harmonic Unification War.

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:47.390
Good job!

00:07:47.390 --> 00:07:49.150
Maybe I should call on
Suzu again next time.

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:52.920
Hey! So guys,

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:56.520
I'm holding a crazy
pre-pop-the-question party tonight.

00:07:56.520 --> 00:07:57.700
Gather up at...

00:07:57.930 --> 00:07:59.660
Don't choose a place that costs money.

00:07:59.900 --> 00:08:01.380
Here works!

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:03.580
Let's play a game of dare like last year!

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:06.960
Tori, that may not be such a good idea.

00:08:07.300 --> 00:08:11.220
The number of spooks have
increased since last year.

00:08:11.400 --> 00:08:14.770
Then, let's exorcise the ghosts tonight!

00:08:14.770 --> 00:08:16.600
It's our duty as part of the Student Council.

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:19.650
I was gonna handle that,

00:08:19.650 --> 00:08:21.390
so I signed up for night duty tonight.

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:22.720
So it's settled!

00:08:22.720 --> 00:08:23.690
We're exercising ghosts!

00:08:24.130 --> 00:08:26.070
Now, that aside...

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:28.440
Tori, it's punishment time.

00:08:28.740 --> 00:08:29.320
Huh?

00:08:29.630 --> 00:08:33.350
In my classes, you get points
for answering a question.

00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:35.240
And you're punished if you can't.

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:36.820
Remember?

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:39.270
It was in Suzu's review.

00:08:39.270 --> 00:08:43.080
The Northern Court began its
dictatorship in 1413.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:43.960
It was a minor mistake.

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:47.470
But the rest of her summary
made up for that,

00:08:47.470 --> 00:08:48.630
so Suzu's okay!

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:52.500
Besides, I don't punish students
over mistakes in a review.

00:08:52.870 --> 00:08:53.720
But...

00:08:53.930 --> 00:08:58.050
A certain idiot said I could
whack him if she messed up.

00:08:58.050 --> 00:08:58.600
Uh-oh!

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:02.010
Tori's requested form of
punishment this month was...

00:09:03.010 --> 00:09:04.350
Well, get stripping.

00:09:04.550 --> 00:09:08.690
Wow! I wrote something
that soft core again?

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:14.950
After the war, the people who fell to
Earth from the Heavens thought:

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:20.000
Maybe we can return to the Heavens
without having to destroy ourselves.

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:23.220
The people then came up with an idea.

00:09:23.220 --> 00:09:26.140
If we follow humanity's footsteps,

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:29.210
someday we'll be able to
return to the Heavens.

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:32.690
That's why they made the Testament.

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:36.500
It's a history book that covers
our old world's history.

00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:37.970
Strip! Strip! Strip!

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:43.180
Another layer! Strip another layer!

00:09:44.460 --> 00:09:47.320
Jeez, Musashi's civilians are cold.

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:51.010
Azuma, no one is celebrating
your glorious return

00:09:51.010 --> 00:09:53.530
even though you're the emperor's son.

00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:57.470
No, the Testament said not
to make a big fuss.

00:09:59.090 --> 00:10:02.470
Keep going! Keep stripping!

00:10:01.210 --> 00:10:03.950
Man, you're pervs!

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:05.320
What are they doing?!

00:10:04.850 --> 00:10:07.730
Censored

00:10:07.770 --> 00:10:22.990
Class 3-Plum

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:10.120
What're you doing, Teach?!

00:10:10.120 --> 00:10:12.950
Ah, hey! N..No!

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:17.200
Oh, hi! We're in the middle of class.

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:20.580
A..Azuma, wait in the teacher's lounge
'til I assign you a room.

00:10:20.860 --> 00:10:23.900
Oh, wow! If it isn't Ms. Sanyo.

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:25.290
Hey, it'll be okay.

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:26.520
You'll be okay, Mitsuki.

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:30.500
10:54 A.M.
Cemetery in Okutama

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:38.200
P-01s?

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:40.640
What brought you here?

00:10:44.430 --> 00:10:48.230
List of
Instructor's
Comments

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:48.250
I'm surprised to see you here.

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:49.620
Straightening up the place?

00:10:48.270 --> 00:10:52.230
11:01 A.M.
Cemetery in Okutama

00:10:49.890 --> 00:10:53.290
Judge. It's one of my daily chores.

00:10:55.140 --> 00:10:56.280
We busted?

00:10:56.280 --> 00:10:57.670
We okay? All good?

00:10:57.860 --> 00:10:59.150
You aren't busted.

00:10:59.150 --> 00:11:00.390
All is well.

00:11:00.390 --> 00:11:02.370
Our operation is proceeding perfectly.

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:03.600
<i>They're so busted!</i>

00:11:04.210 --> 00:11:08.880
Masazumi, I see you take
good care of this grave.

00:11:08.880 --> 00:11:11.270
Yeah, it's my mother's.

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:14.000
Honda Family Grave

00:11:11.570 --> 00:11:14.020
We buried a keepsake since we
don't have her remains.

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:17.340
But I guess an automated doll
wouldn't understand.

00:11:17.810 --> 00:11:21.160
You don't have a mother since
you were born from a soul.

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:21.990
Judge.

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:24.710
But quite bluntly,

00:11:25.310 --> 00:11:28.250
you love your mother, don't you?

00:11:33.240 --> 00:11:40.050
Kono ko no too no oiwai ni

00:11:33.240 --> 00:11:40.050
To celebrate this child's tenth

00:11:40.540 --> 00:11:47.070
Ryou no ofuda wo osame ni sanzu

00:11:40.540 --> 00:11:47.070
I must make an offering with these talismans

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:53.910
Iki wa yoi nagi, kaeri wa kowaki

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:53.910
The path out is pleasant, but returning is scary

00:11:53.910 --> 00:11:57.650
Waga naka kowaki no

00:11:53.910 --> 00:11:57.650
Can I pass despite

00:11:57.650 --> 00:12:03.750
Tooshi kana?

00:11:57.650 --> 00:12:03.750
My fears?

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:07.370
Is something the matter, Masazumi?

00:12:09.380 --> 00:12:11.800
I'm originally from Mikawa.

00:12:12.390 --> 00:12:14.380
Mikawa's sovereign, Lord Matsudaira,

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:17.380
needs two people from
the Honda family under him.

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:21.550
The first represents a member of
the Four Divine Matsudaira Kings,

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:25.010
Tadakatsu Honda from the warrior
branch of the Honda family.

00:12:25.460 --> 00:12:31.020
The other represents Masanobu Honda
from the internal affairs branch.

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:35.540
My father tried and failed
to inherit the Masanobu name.

00:12:35.820 --> 00:12:40.610
Then, he tried to get me to inherit
Masanobu's son's name, Masazumi.

00:12:41.310 --> 00:12:43.500
But it wasn't meant to be.

00:12:44.480 --> 00:12:47.780
In order to avoid hurting my chances,

00:12:48.230 --> 00:12:50.680
my parents had me undergo a sex change.

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:53.520
First, I lost my bosom.

00:12:53.840 --> 00:12:56.920
Just when I was preparing to
undergo transgender surgery,

00:12:57.810 --> 00:13:01.840
the Matsudaira family suddenly
dismissed their vassals.

00:13:05.850 --> 00:13:09.310
Countless vassals were
demoted or discharged.

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:13.890
They entrusted everything to
automated dolls thereafter.

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:16.640
My family was no exception.

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:21.390
Without purpose, my father fled to Musashi.

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:26.880
My mother and I remained in Mikawa
until she got spirited away,

00:13:26.880 --> 00:13:28.440
becoming a Lost Noble.

00:13:29.590 --> 00:13:33.380
I wonder why I've had to
relinquish so much?

00:13:34.820 --> 00:13:36.270
Talk about pathetic!

00:13:37.210 --> 00:13:38.230
Judge.

00:13:38.230 --> 00:13:41.920
You have just resolved one of my
questions regarding you.

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:43.170
What's that?

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:46.080
You haven't been wearing a boy's uniform

00:13:46.080 --> 00:13:49.300
because you want to, surprisingly enough.

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:50.890
Brash!

00:13:51.250 --> 00:13:52.730
<i>Hey, hold it!</i>

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:01.730
We've left stealth mode.

00:14:01.730 --> 00:14:03.570
So, we're almost there.

00:14:06.810 --> 00:14:09.320
I wonder how much
it's changed over the year?

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:12.210
I hope Futayo Honda is okay.

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:15.560
