00:14:18.680 --> 00:14:20.600
<i>Hey, long time, no see!</i>

00:14:20.600 --> 00:14:22.430
<i>Do you remember me?</i>

00:14:22.430 --> 00:14:26.510
<i>Once again, I'm the Lord of Mikawa,
