citing all her good points.

00:16:11.110 --> 00:16:13.890
Her good points?

00:16:13.890 --> 00:16:17.450
I wonder if I can put it into words...

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:22.920
I can't describe how her face
is totally my type.

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:27.340
I can't describe how it looks like
 I can see her panties through

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:29.550
