00:16:30.020 --> 00:16:34.760
I can't describe the epicness of the
curve going from her waist to her butt.

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:37.750
You're spouting it out easily enough!

00:16:37.750 --> 00:16:39.990
Wait, wait! That list...

00:16:39.990 --> 00:16:42.560
is missing something of dire
importance for Tori.

00:16:42.960 --> 00:16:47.610
You're a boob-man, yet you've
failed to mention them.

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:52.070
I'm amazed Breast Connoisseur Tori
hasn't mentioned that!

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:54.180
He yaps about them everyday.

00:16:54.180 --> 00:16:56.010
Is he awkward around the girl he likes?

