Sis, you're awesome!

00:17:28.740 --> 00:17:30.760
You're stupid even though you're smart!

00:17:30.760 --> 00:17:33.690
Why is everyone lazing about out here?

00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:36.250
Neit! Prez!

00:17:36.250 --> 00:17:38.600
Yo! I heard the news, Tori.

00:17:38.600 --> 00:17:39.830
