00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:46.960
Horizon!

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:50.920
Her, eh?

00:17:51.370 --> 00:17:54.070
So, you think so too?

00:17:54.070 --> 00:17:55.900
Wouldn't you agree?

00:17:55.900 --> 00:18:00.670
Yeah, but there's a chance
she just resembles her.

00:18:00.670 --> 00:18:02.100
I know that!

00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:05.100
It's cool if she isn't Horizon.

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:06.940
I may be damn incapable,

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:08.810
