00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:10.540
When did you decide that?

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:11.400
This morning.

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:15.610
It popped into my head when I was
thinking about how Horizon died

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:17.490
