00:18:29.390 --> 00:18:31.560
We're gonna start partying here at eight,

00:18:31.560 --> 00:18:33.210
so could you ask if she's coming or not?

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:34.920
Judge, judge.

00:18:36.080 --> 00:18:40.170
