00:19:47.680 --> 00:19:48.680
Foolish brother?

00:19:48.680 --> 00:19:50.000
How was it, Sir Tori?

00:19:51.730 --> 00:19:53.090
She was braless!

00:19:55.650 --> 00:19:57.280
I owe ya, Neit.

00:19:57.280 --> 00:19:59.420
